# C++ Testing

**Activation gate:** apply this rule only for an explicit current-task user-authorized `TEST_TASK`; otherwise do not create, edit, or run tests.

> This file extends [common/testing.md](../common/testing.md) with C++ specific content.

## Framework

Use **GoogleTest** (gtest/gmock) with **CMake/CTest**.

## Running Tests

```bash
cmake --build build && ctest --test-dir build --output-on-failure
```

## Coverage

```bash
cmake -DCMAKE_CXX_FLAGS="--coverage" -DCMAKE_EXE_LINKER_FLAGS="--coverage" ..
cmake --build .
ctest --output-on-failure
lcov --capture --directory . --output-file coverage.info
```

## Sanitizers

When the current user explicitly authorizes C++ testing for this task, run the selected tests with relevant sanitizers in CI:

```bash
cmake -DCMAKE_CXX_FLAGS="-fsanitize=address,undefined" ..
```

